   "created_at": "2026-04-25T11:25:55Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-04-25T11:25:55Z",
   "body": "Hello @anthonykim1 ,\r\n\r\nPlease review this PR if and when you get the opportunity. Since this is my first major contribution to a large open source project, I apologise in advance if this message is out of place. This PR would significantly improve QoL on VS Code as well as its fork IDEs as currently the IDE's Rich Terminal is broken on all of them if system is on ConstrainedLanguage Audit mode, which is true for majority of the new dev machines we have received at our company that are Copilot+/Recall certified.\r\n\r\nOnce again, no urgency implied, just that my team is eager to see these fixes on their machines. Currently we are manually applying these fixes after each update.",
   "author_association": "NONE",
